				"description": "{H6 Memorial Shrine}\n\nA shrine in memory of H6, guarded by a full army of upgraded level 1-7 creatures from one H6 faction. After defeating the guards, a hero whose army contains upgraded level 1-7 creatures of one H6 faction (one stack per level) can permanently master all the active skills of that faction's Might class here (for the Sanctuary, Jinx). Each player can do this only once.\n\nHaven: {Divine Justice}, {Anathema}, {Hour of Judgement}\nInferno: {Seal of Power}, {Mark of Chaos}\nNecropolis: {Destruction}\nStronghold: {Unfettered}, {Might over Magic}, {Blood Fury}, {Power of the Horde}\nDungeon: {Feign Death}, {Diversion}, {Stalking Shade}, {Dark Transfer}\nSanctuary: {Jinx} — at the start of combat, each enemy stack randomly gets one of Chilled, Frozen, Soaked or Dazed.",
