						"message": "{H6 Memorial Shrine}\n\nYour army has gathered upgraded level 1-7 creatures of the H6 Haven faction. Do you want your hero to permanently master the Haven skills?\n\n{Divine Justice}\nThe target enemy takes part of the total damage its attacks have dealt this battle.\n{Anathema}\nLowers the damage, Defense, Morale and Luck of all enemies; cannot be dispelled.\n{Hour of Judgement}\nThis round, your troops deal more damage to enemies under Anathema.\n\nThese skills go into the hero's spells and can be cast without a spellbook; their effects improve with hero level (three tiers: levels 1-9, 10-19, 20+).\n\nEach player can master skills at the H6 Memorial Shrine only once."
