						"message": "{H6 Memorial Shrine}\n\nYour army has gathered upgraded level 1-7 creatures of the H6 Stronghold faction. Do you want your hero to permanently master the Stronghold skills?\n\n{Unfettered}\nDispels slowing, Morale-lowering and Attack-lowering negative spells from all your troops.\n{Might over Magic}\nFor 2 rounds, magic damage taken by all your troops is reduced.\n{Blood Fury}\nThe target friendly H6 Stronghold stack gets +2 H6 Blood Rage level and +2 rounds of duration.\n{Power of the Horde}\nDeals physical damage to the target enemy based on the total Hit Points of your whole army.\n\nThese skills go into the hero's spells and can be cast without a spellbook; their effects improve with hero level (three tiers: levels 1-9, 10-19, 20+).\n\nEach player can master skills at the H6 Memorial Shrine only once."
