						"message": "{H6 Memorial Shrine}\n\nYour army has gathered upgraded level 1-7 creatures of the H6 Dungeon faction. Do you want your hero to permanently master the Dungeon skills?\n\n{Feign Death}\nThe first time your stack is attacked, it takes no damage and lies down until the next round.\n{Diversion}\nPlaces a decoy; nearby enemies lose control.\n{Stalking Shade}\nPlaces an illusion next to your stack; adjacent enemies deal less damage.\n{Dark Transfer}\nThe target friendly stack acts next.\n\nThese skills go into the hero's spells and can be cast without a spellbook; their effects improve with hero level (three tiers: levels 1-9, 10-19, 20+).\n\nEach player can master skills at the H6 Memorial Shrine only once."
